      "reason": "Five independent groups of pooled animals (no subject repeated across groups: separate mice per time point, S2.1.p1). One DESeq2 model on all samples of the tissue, as iDEP does, with the paper's pairwise comparisons. Rejected: pooling single-bout time points; tissue as a factor (paper analyzes tissues separately, separate matrices). Cartilage exercise arms have n=2 (control n=3), so all cartilage contrasts are exploratory. Stopped: the runner's suitability gate (tools/suitability.py:259-277, 502-505) makes sample_size a hard fail when no comparison has n>=3 per arm, and tools/decision_contract.py:172-173 rejects a valid design under that verdict, although the skill says small n alone is not a stop.",
